     "nature": "accounting",
     "title": "Unrealised bond losses under US GAAP and large nat cat losses",
     "detail": "Rising rates created large unrealised losses on the bond portfolio. Under US GAAP these reduced equity (via OCI) while insurance liabilities were not remeasured — equity roughly halved although economic solvency stayed strong. Hurricane Ian and other events depressed net income.",
     "where_to_verify": "Statement of comprehensive income; statement of shareholders' equity; nat cat disclosures in the P&C Re results."
